    "Once upon a time": "很久很久以前",
    "Long ago, the goddess Shiria gathered the world's fairy tales into one land: Fairyland. Villages grew up between the stories, and adventurers came from far and wide to explore them.": "很久以前，女神希莉亚把世界上所有的童话汇聚到了一片土地上，那就是Fairyland。故事与故事之间长出了一座座村庄，冒险者们从四面八方赶来探索。",
    "Lately the tales have been going wrong. A Big Bad Wolf prowls the Snow White Forest. A Rat King has cut off the dwarves of Goldburg. A dragon drinks at the oasis in Genie Desert and scares away the caravans.": "可最近，童话开始出岔子了。大野狼在白雪公主森林里游荡；鼠王切断了黄金堡矮人们的出路；一条龙霸占了神灯沙漠的绿洲饮酒，吓跑了往来的商队。",
    "You arrive in Meadowbrook as a new adventurer, with the whole of Fairyland ahead of you.": "你作为一名新冒险者来到了溪草村，整个Fairyland都在前方等着你。",
    "Walk": "移动",
    "Drag the stick in the corner, or tap the ground and your hero walks there.": "拖动角落的摇杆，或者点击地面，角色就会走过去。",
    "Battle": "战斗",
    "Monsters jump out as you explore the wild. Battles take turns: attack, cast a skill or use an item.": "在野外探索时会有怪物跳出来。战斗是回合制的：攻击、施放技能或使用道具。",
    "Beat a group down to its last monster, weaken it below 20% health and throw a Seal Stone. Keep up to five.": "把一群怪物打到只剩最后一只，再把它的生命削弱到20%以下，然后扔出封印石。最多可以拥有五只。",
    "Grow": "成长",
    "Every level gives a skill point. At level {level}, visit a guild master in town to become a Fighter, Mage or Beast Tamer.": "每升一级获得一个技能点。到{level}级时，去城镇拜访公会会长，就能成为战士、法师或驯兽师。",
    "Villagers with a gold ! have work for you. Quests reward you and open the roads to new places.": "头上有金色！的村民有事要拜托你。完成任务能获得奖励，还能打通通往新地方的道路。",
    "Towns": "城镇",
    "Shops, healers and checkpoints wait in town. Your progress saves by itself.": "城镇里有商店、治疗师和存档点。游戏进度会自动保存。",
